{"seq":2,"slug":"drayage-cost-accrual-accessorial-billing","title":"短驳成本归集与附加费计费：运价模型、代垫费用与对账结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/chassis-cost-carrier-kpi-operations/drayage-cost-accrual-accessorial-billing","wordCount":3177,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"短驳成本归集与附加费计费-运价模型-代垫费用与对账结算\">短驳成本归集与附加费计费：运价模型、代垫费用与对账结算</h1><p>一票从洛杉矶港提重到内陆仓库的短驳，账面运费可能是 480 美元，但月末结算单常常是 720 美元。差额不在运价：等了两小时四十分钟的等待费、底盘车多占用两天的 per diem、码头归集的交通缓解费与清洁卡车基金费、以及车队替货主先垫付的过磅费和超重许可费。这些条目各有各的计费口径、承担方和争议时限。本文把「一次短驳到底花了多少钱、这笔钱该记给谁、用什么证据核销」拆成可建模、可核算、可对账的工程结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-账单不是一张账-而是三张彼此独立的账\">核心概念：账单不是一张账，而是三张彼此独立的账</h2><p>短驳成本之所以难以归集，是因为它把三件节奏完全不同的事挤进了同一张发票。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>运价账（Linehaul Tariff）</strong>：按移动类型和距离计算的运输对价，派单前即确定，属<strong>事前定价</strong>。争议几乎全部来自「这票算什么移动类型」。</li>\n<li><strong>附加费账（Accessorial）</strong>：由执行过程中的<strong>实际事件</strong>触发——等待时长、底盘车占用天数、二次搬移、改约。它只能按事件观测结果与合同口径折算。</li>\n<li><strong>代垫账（Advance / Paid-on-Behalf）</strong>：车队或货代替另一主体先行支付的第三方费用（码头费、过磅费、许可费），本质是<strong>资金过手</strong>而非收入，需票据级证据核销。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把三张账混成一个「应付总额」字段，是短驳成本系统最典型的设计错误：它让附加费失去事件溯源，让代垫款无法与凭证绑定。正确方向是让三张账各自拥有独立数据源、时间戳基础与核销路径，只在结算单据层合并。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账类</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>定价时点</th>\n<th>承担方默认</th>\n<th>主要争议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运价账</td>\n<td>合同费率表 + 移动类型 + 里程</td>\n<td>派单前</td>\n<td>货主</td>\n<td>移动类型归类、绕行里程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附加费账</td>\n<td>执行事件流（GPS/闸口/底盘记录）</td>\n<td>事件发生后</td>\n<td>视条款</td>\n<td>事件的起止时点与免费时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代垫账</td>\n<td>第三方票据（码头/地磅/许可）</td>\n<td>支付发生后</td>\n<td>通过条款转嫁</td>\n<td>票据真实性、是否重复计费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[派单] --&gt; B[合同费率表冻结&lt;br/&gt;移动类型 + 里程]&#10;  B --&gt; C[执行事件采集&lt;br/&gt;到达/闸口/离场/底盘归还]&#10;  C --&gt; D{触发附加费?}&#10;  D --&gt;|等待超免费时长| E[等待费计算]&#10;  D --&gt;|底盘超期占用| F[per diem 计算]&#10;  D --&gt;|二次搬移/改约| G[改约费计算]&#10;  C --&gt; H[第三方票据归集]&#10;  H --&gt; I[代垫账登记]&#10;  E --&gt; J[发票行项合并]&#10;  F --&gt; J&#10;  G --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  B --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[三单匹配&lt;br/&gt;订单/费率确认/发票]&#10;  K --&gt;|在容差内| L[自动核销]&#10;  K --&gt;|超容差| M[争议状态机]\">graph TD\n  A[派单] --&gt; B[合同费率表冻结&lt;br/&gt;移动类型 + 里程]\n  B --&gt; C[执行事件采集&lt;br/&gt;到达/闸口/离场/底盘归还]\n  C --&gt; D{触发附加费?}\n  D --&gt;|等待超免费时长| E[等待费计算]\n  D --&gt;|底盘超期占用| F[per diem 计算]\n  D --&gt;|二次搬移/改约| G[改约费计算]\n  C --&gt; H[第三方票据归集]\n  H --&gt; I[代垫账登记]\n  E --&gt; J[发票行项合并]\n  F --&gt; J\n  G --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  B --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[三单匹配&lt;br/&gt;订单/费率确认/发票]\n  K --&gt;|在容差内| L[自动核销]\n  K --&gt;|超容差| M[争议状态机]</pre><h2 id=\"运价模型-定价结构决定成本的可归因性\">运价模型：定价结构决定成本的可归因性</h2><p>短驳运价不是单价乘数量，而是<strong>按移动类型分片的费率表</strong>：进口提重（import laden pickup）从码头到仓库、出口送重（export laden delivery）从仓库到码头、空箱回场（empty return）回指定堆场，同一个箱在不同方向上是三行不同价格。移动类型是整张费率表的<strong>分片键</strong>，必须与 <a href=\"../drayage-network-operating-model/container-move-lifecycle-status-model\">箱流生命周期与搬移状态模型</a> 的状态枚举严格对齐——状态机多一个中间状态，费率表就少一个可计费分片。</p>\n<p>工程上常见的五种定价结构各有各的成本驱动：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>计费口径</th>\n<th>成本风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定包干</td>\n<td>每移动一笔固定价</td>\n<td>绕行与等待完全由承运人吸收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按英里</td>\n<td>每英里单价 × 实际里程</td>\n<td>里程口径（最短路径 vs 实际路径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按箱型</td>\n<td>每箱按 20/40/45 尺分档</td>\n<td>重箱/空箱未区分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>往返计价</td>\n<td>对每一对「送重+提空」组合定价</td>\n<td>配对失败时的空驶计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃油联动</td>\n<td>基础价 + 燃油指数调整</td>\n<td>基准指数与调整公式不透明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>燃油联动项的工程要点是<strong>把指数选取和调整公式写死成可重算的规则</strong>，而非每期手工改价。北美公路运输普遍以美国能源信息署（EIA）每周公布的<strong>柴油零售均价</strong>（On-Highway Diesel Fuel Price）为基准，约定触发油价与基准燃油经济性，形成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FSC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>Diesel</mtext><mtext>current</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>Diesel</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mtext>MPG</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>distance</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FSC} = \\frac{\\text{Diesel}_{\\text{current}} - \\text{Diesel}_{\\text{base}}}{\\text{MPG}_{\\text{base}}} \\times \\text{distance}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FSC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Diesel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">current</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Diesel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">distance</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Diesel</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Diesel}_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Diesel</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>MPG</mtext><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MPG}_{\\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为合同参数存储，任何一周的附加费都能从历史油价序列重算，争议时无需翻邮件。费率表是带生效日的版本化对象，历史单据按当时版本重算，不回溯改写——与 <a href=\"../drayage-network-operating-model/motor-carrier-qualification-contract\">短驳合同条款的工程化建模</a> 的立场一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"附加费的可计费化-把执行事件翻译成金额\">附加费的可计费化：把执行事件翻译成金额</h2><p>附加费的难点不在于费率，而在于<strong>事件的时间戳基础是否可核验</strong>。合同说「免费等待 120 分钟」，系统就必须能回答：从哪个时刻开始算、到哪个时刻结束、用什么证据。</p>\n<p><strong>等待费（waiting time / detention）<strong>的起算点是「车辆到达并被允许进入队列」，停止点是「作业完成可离场」。这两个时刻不能靠司机手动打点，而应由闸口记录、GPS 地理围栏或码头系统自动生成——这正是 <a href=\"../dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/geofence-eta-transit-visibility\">在途可视与地理围栏</a> 中采集的同一批事件。免费时长通常按码头、箱型分别约定，超出部分按小时阶梯计价，多数合同设有</strong>日封顶（daily cap）</strong>，防止一次堵港把等待费算成天价。</p>\n<p><strong>底盘车 per diem</strong> 是最独特的一项，因为设备通常既不属车队也不属货主。北美绝大多数设备交换在 <strong>UIIA</strong>（Uniform Intermodal Interchange and Facilities Access Agreement，由北美多式联运协会 IANA 运营）这套标准合同下管理，per diem、维修保养与设备使用费的口径与争议路径由它定义，争议走 <strong>UIIA 约束性仲裁</strong>。计费结构是「免费天数 + 阶梯日费率」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PerDiem</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PerDiem} = \\sum_{d=1}^{n} r(d), \\quad r(d)=\\begin{cases} 0 &amp; d \\le d_{\\text{free}} \\\\ r_1 &amp; d_{\\text{free}} &lt; d \\le d_1 \\\\ r_2 &amp; d &gt; d_1 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PerDiem</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程上必须把「设备归还」建成<strong>带证明的事件</strong>而非状态字段——归还时点是计费停止点，缺失证明就意味着车队无法主张停止计费。其余常见附加费按触发源归类：等待/滞留费由闸口进至作业完成触发，按小时阶梯加日封顶，车队开票；二次搬移（改约、换箱、换堆场）按移动类型重算；<strong>清洁卡车基金费</strong>按每 TEU 过港触发、由码头归集；<strong>交通缓解费</strong>由高峰时段过港触发；超重许可与冷箱发电机组（genset）费则是车队先垫后转的典型。</p>\n<p>美西两港的清洁卡车基金费（Clean Truck Fund Rate）按 <strong>每 TEU 10 美元</strong>收取，零排放卡车豁免，洛杉矶港另对在 2022 年底前完成注册的低氮氧化物卡车给豁免至 2027 年底；由 PortCheck 归集、货主或其代理承担。它和 WCMTOA 的 OffPeak 夜间作业计划所收<strong>交通缓解费</strong>一样，都是<strong>政府或码头层面归集、再转嫁到账单</strong>的费用——合同不写清承担方与计量口径（TEU 还是箱数），账单到达时必然争议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代垫费用与合规转嫁-谁替谁垫付-凭什么转嫁\">代垫费用与合规转嫁：谁替谁垫付、凭什么转嫁</h2><p>代垫账的本质是<strong>资金过手</strong>：车队先掏钱付了地磅费、超重许可费或码头费，再向货主报销。它与附加费的区别在于——附加费是车队的服务对价，代垫是第三方的实际支出。因此代垫必须绑定<strong>第三方原始票据</strong>，否则无法证明金额真实且未重复计费。</p>\n<p>转嫁的合法性有硬约束。美国联邦海事委员会（FMC）的<strong>滞期费与滞留费计费规则</strong>（Detention and Demurrage Billing Requirements，编入 <strong>46 CFR Part 541</strong>）自 2024 年 5 月 28 日起生效，核心要求是：滞期费与滞留费发票<strong>只能开给与承运人订立运输合同的主体</strong>（或其明确指定的第三方），发票须含规定明细，并给予<strong>不少于 30 天</strong>的争议期。它把层层转嫁变成有明确开票链的流程，系统必须能追踪<strong>发票的法定收件方</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>InvoiceTo</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Contracting Party</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>FMC 46 CFR 541 口径</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Named Third Party</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>合同明确指定</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{InvoiceTo} = \\begin{cases} \\text{Contracting Party} &amp; \\text{FMC 46 CFR 541 口径} \\\\ \\text{Named Third Party} &amp; \\text{合同明确指定} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InvoiceTo</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Contracting Party</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Named Third Party</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FMC 46 CFR 541 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">口径</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合同明确指定</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>落到数据结构上，发票实体需携带「法定收件方」与「合同依据」两个字段，并在转嫁链路上校验不在链上的主体不得被开票。这与 <a href=\"../dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/dispatch-assignment-driver-workflow\">派单执行与司机作业流</a> 中司机在端上提交的作业证据是同一条证据链的下游——没有可核验的进闸/离场/归还记录，任何附加费与代垫都无法通过审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账结算-三单匹配-容差与争议状态机\">对账结算：三单匹配、容差与争议状态机</h2><p>结算的核心动作是<strong>三单匹配</strong>（three-way match）：把「业务订单/费率确认（rate confirmation）」「执行事件与第三方票据」「承运商发票」三者比对。行业上这层数据流动依赖 ANSI ASC X12 的报文族：<strong>EDI 210</strong>（Motor Carrier Freight Details and Invoice）承载承运商发票明细，<strong>EDI 214</strong>（Transportation Carrier Shipment Status Message）承载在途状态，<strong>EDI 322</strong>（Terminal Operations and Intermodal Ramp Activity）承载码头作业活动。发票对账系统消费 210 的行项，与本地的费率表重算结果逐行比对。</p>\n<p>差额处置靠两条规则：<strong>容差</strong>与<strong>争议窗口</strong>。低于容差（例如发票总额的 2% 或固定 25 美元）的差异直接核销，避免为几分钱启动争议流程；超容差则进入争议状态机。争议状态机必须是<strong>显式状态</strong>而非邮件往来，因为 FMC 与 UIIA 都规定了争议时限——错过时限意味着丧失抗辩权。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[承运商发票 EDI 210] --&gt; B[按费率表重算]&#10;  B --&gt; C{逐行差额比对}&#10;  C --&gt;|差额 ≤ 容差| D[自动核销]&#10;  C --&gt;|差额 &gt; 容差| E[生成争议行项]&#10;  E --&gt; F{证据是否充分?}&#10;  F --&gt;|事件 + 票据齐全| G[协商调整 / short-pay]&#10;  F --&gt;|证据缺失| H[要求补证]&#10;  H --&gt;|超争议窗口未补| I[按发票付款并记损失]&#10;  G --&gt; J[达成调整金额]&#10;  J --&gt; K[核销并回流成本]&#10;  I --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[承运商发票 EDI 210] --&gt; B[按费率表重算]\n  B --&gt; C{逐行差额比对}\n  C --&gt;|差额 ≤ 容差| D[自动核销]\n  C --&gt;|差额 &gt; 容差| E[生成争议行项]\n  E --&gt; F{证据是否充分?}\n  F --&gt;|事件 + 票据齐全| G[协商调整 / short-pay]\n  F --&gt;|证据缺失| H[要求补证]\n  H --&gt;|超争议窗口未补| I[按发票付款并记损失]\n  G --&gt; J[达成调整金额]\n  J --&gt; K[核销并回流成本]\n  I --&gt; K</pre><p><strong>short-pay</strong>（部分付款）是实践中常用的施压手段：对无争议部分照付，对争议部分暂扣。它有效，但必须绑定明确的争议行项与时限，否则会在承运商端触发催收与信用降级，伤害 <a href=\"../drayage-network-operating-model/motor-carrier-qualification-contract\">承运商资质与运力池</a> 所依赖的合作关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本归集-把每一美元落到可行动的维度\">成本归集：把每一美元落到可行动的维度</h2><p>结算完成不等于成本管理完成。归集的目标是让每一美元落到一个<strong>可行动的维度</strong>上——哪个码头、哪种移动类型、哪个客户、哪家承运商带来的。口径上不该只看「每票运费」，而要看四个比值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单箱全成本</td>\n<td>运价 + 附加费 + 代垫 ÷ 箱数</td>\n<td>客户报价与毛利核算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附加费率</td>\n<td>附加费 ÷ 运价账</td>\n<td>识别契约性成本泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底盘车周转天数</td>\n<td>提取至归还的平均天数</td>\n<td>与设备提供方谈判 per diem</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待占比</td>\n<td>等待费 ÷ 总成本</td>\n<td>定位码头拥堵与预约失配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中<strong>附加费率</strong>最有诊断价值：它把「附加费是偶发事件」的假设直接证伪。若某条线路的附加费率长期高于 30%，问题多半不在承运商，而在 <a href=\"../terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/appointment-window-quota-model\">码头预约窗口配额模型</a> 所述的预约配额与实际作业能力不匹配——车到了没有窗口，等待费自然高企。这时正确的动作是修预约策略，而不是和车队砍等待费。</p>\n<p>成本数据还应回流到承运商评价：把单箱全成本、等待占比与争议率合起来形成<strong>总持有成本</strong>视图，而非只看名义运价。最低报价的承运商若附加费率翻倍，其实际成本往往最高——这正是分层派单需把成本 KPI 与履约可靠性一起纳入排序的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>短驳账单由<strong>运价账、附加费账、代垫账</strong>三张独立账构成：运价事前定价、附加费由事件触发、代垫是资金过手必须绑定第三方票据。</li>\n<li>运价表的<strong>分片键是移动类型</strong>，须与箱流状态机严格对齐；燃油联动项把 EIA 柴油指数与基准参数写死成可重算规则。</li>\n<li>附加费的可计费性取决于<strong>事件时间戳的可核验性</strong>：等待费依赖闸口/围栏事件，底盘车 per diem 依赖带证明的归还事件，口径遵循 UIIA。</li>\n<li>合规转嫁有硬约束：FMC <strong>46 CFR Part 541</strong> 规定滞期费与滞留费只能开给运输合同主体，须含规定明细并给不少于 30 天争议期。</li>\n<li>对账靠<strong>三单匹配 + 容差 + 争议状态机</strong>，数据流动走 EDI 210/214/322；short-pay 必须绑定明确行项与时限。</li>\n<li>归集的落点是四个比值：单箱全成本、<strong>附加费率</strong>、底盘车周转天数、等待占比——附加费率长期偏高通常是预约策略问题而非承运商问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"短驳成本归集与附加费计费：运价模型、代垫费用与对账结算","id":"短驳成本归集与附加费计费-运价模型-代垫费用与对账结算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：账单不是一张账，而是三张彼此独立的账","id":"核心概念-账单不是一张账-而是三张彼此独立的账"},{"level":2,"text":"运价模型：定价结构决定成本的可归因性","id":"运价模型-定价结构决定成本的可归因性"},{"level":2,"text":"附加费的可计费化：把执行事件翻译成金额","id":"附加费的可计费化-把执行事件翻译成金额"},{"level":2,"text":"代垫费用与合规转嫁：谁替谁垫付、凭什么转嫁","id":"代垫费用与合规转嫁-谁替谁垫付-凭什么转嫁"},{"level":2,"text":"对账结算：三单匹配、容差与争议状态机","id":"对账结算-三单匹配-容差与争议状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"成本归集：把每一美元落到可行动的维度","id":"成本归集-把每一美元落到可行动的维度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"底盘车池与使用管理：车架归属、免费期与池化调度的成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/chassis-cost-carrier-kpi-operations/chassis-pool-usage-management"},"next":{"title":"承运商 KPI 记分卡与运营治理：准时率、拒单率与运力绩效度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/chassis-cost-carrier-kpi-operations/carrier-kpi-scorecard-governance"}}